==== History ====
Located near other provincial landmarks like the {{ill|Kai Kokubun-ji|ja|甲斐国分寺}} and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.

