This shrine, located in Hashitate, Fuefuki City, is another Ronsha contender. Its name, "Jinsogu," reflects its association with ancestral spirits or the provincial Sōja.

==== Deities ====
* {{ill|Kuninotokotachi|ja|国之常立尊}}
* {{ill|Takami Musubi|ja|高皇産霊尊}}
* {{ill|Izanagi|ja|伊弉諾尊}}
* {{ill|Izanami|ja|伊弉冉尊}}

==== History ====
Located near other provincial landmarks like the {{ill|Kai Kokubun-ji|ja|甲斐国分寺}} and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.

