=== Kaina Shrine (Kofu) === {{Infobox religious building| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]] | name = Kaina Shrine | image = [[File:Kaina Shrine Kofu City,from the road outside.JPG|250px]] | location = 3-7-11 Chūō, Kofu City, Yamanashi Prefecture | coordinates = {{Coord|35|39|40.47|N|138|34|41.35|E|region:JP-19_type:landmark|display=inline,title}} | deity = {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|12=draft|12=draft}} | status = {{ill|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|12=draft|12=draft}} contender, former {{ill|Gōsha|ja|郷社|12=draft|12=draft}} | founded = Reign of {{ill|Emperor Suizei|ja|綏靖天皇|12=draft|12=draft}} | main_hall = | othernames = Shirayama Gongen | festivals = {{nihongo|April 15|4月15日}} | rituals = }}
