==== History ==== Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)|12=draft|12=draft}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992|12=draft|12=draft}}</ref>
