=== Kaina Shrine (Kofu) === {{Infobox religious building| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]] | name = Kaina Shrine | image = [[File:Kaina Shrine Kofu City,from the road outside.JPG|250px]] | location = 3-7-11 Chūō, Kofu City, Yamanashi Prefecture | coordinates = {{Coord|35|39|40.47|N|138|34|41.35|E|region:JP-19_type:landmark|display=inline,title}} | deity = {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命}}, {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命}} | status = {{ill|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha}} contender, former {{ill|Gōsha|ja|郷社}} | founded = Reign of {{ill|Emperor Suizei|ja|綏靖天皇}} | main_hall = | othernames = Shirayama Gongen | festivals = {{nihongo|April 15|4月15日}} | rituals = }}
This shrine is located in Kofu City and is linked to the ancient Shirayama faith. It has been known by various names, including "Shirayama Gongen."
==== Deities ==== ; Main Deities * {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命}} * {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命}} ; Associated Deities * {{ill|Ninigi|ja|瓊瓊杵命}} * {{ill|Ōyamatsumi|ja|大山祇命|1=Ōyamatsumi}} * [[Iwanaga-hime]]
==== History ==== Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992}}</ref>
