This shrine is located in Kofu City and is linked to the ancient Shirayama faith. It has been known by various names, including "Shirayama Gongen."

==== Deities ====
; Main Deities
* {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|12=draft|12=draft}}
* {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|12=draft|12=draft}}
; Associated Deities
* {{ill|Ninigi|ja|瓊瓊杵命|12=draft|12=draft}}
* {{ill|Ōyamatsumi|ja|大山祇命|1=Ōyamatsumi|12=draft|12=draft}}
* [[Iwanaga-hime]]

==== History ====
Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)|12=draft|12=draft}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992|12=draft|12=draft}}</ref>

