Located near other provincial landmarks like the {{ill|Kai Kokubun-ji|ja|甲斐国分寺|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kai Kokubun-ji|qq=}} and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kai Kokubun-niji|qq=}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.

