This shrine is located in Kofu City and is linked to the ancient Shirayama faith. It has been known by various names, including "Shirayama Gongen."

==== Deities ====
; Main Deities
* {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kukurihime no Mikoto|qq=}}
* {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konohana Sakuya Hime|qq=}}
; Associated Deities
* {{ill|Ninigi-no-Mikoto|lt=Ninigi-no-Mikoto|lt=Ninigi|ja|瓊瓊杵命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninigi|qq=}}
* {{ill|Ōyamatsumi|ja|大山祇命|1=Ōyamatsumi|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōyamatsumi|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōyamatsumi|qq=}}
* [[Iwanaga-hime]]

==== History ====
Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Atago-yama|qq=}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Edo period|qq=}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992|qq=draft|qq=draft}}</ref>

