This shrine, located in Hashitate, Fuefuki City, is another Ronsha contender. Its name, "Jinsogu," reflects its association with ancestral spirits or the provincial Sōja.

==== Deities ====
* {{ill|Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuninotokotachi|ja|国之常立尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kuninotokotachi|qq=}}
* {{ill|Takami Musubi|ja|高皇産霊尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Takami Musubi|qq=}}
* {{ill|Izanagi|ja|伊弉諾尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanagi|qq=}}
* {{ill|Izanami|ja|伊弉冉尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanami|qq=}}

==== History ====
Located near other provincial landmarks like the [[:en:Kai Kokubun-ji|Kai Kokubun-ji]] and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kai Kokubun-niji|qq=}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.

