=== Kaina Shrine (Hashitate, Fuefuki) === {{Infobox religious building| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]] | name = Kaina Shrine | image = [[File:甲斐奈神社 (笛吹市一宮町橋立) 拝殿斜め.JPG|250px]] | location = 84 Hashitate, Fuefuki City, Yamanashi Prefecture | coordinates = {{Coord|35|38|50.33|N|138|40|45.71|E|region:JP-19_type:landmark|display=inline,title|qq=draft|qq=draft}} | deity = {{ill|Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuninotokotachi|ja|国之常立尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kuninotokotachi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, {{ill|Takami Musubi|ja|高皇産霊尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Takami Musubi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to タカミムスビ}}, {{ill|Izanagi|ja|伊弉諾尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanagi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to イザナギ}}, {{ill|Izanami|ja|伊弉冉尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanami|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to イザナミ}} | status = {{ill|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|2=ja|3=式内社|qq=draft|1=Shikinaisha|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikinaisha|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikinaisha|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 延喜式神名帳}} contender, Sōja contender, former {{ill|Mura-sha|ja|村社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Mura-sha|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 近代社格制度}} | founded = | main_hall = | othernames = Jinsogu, Hashitate Daimyōjin | festivals = {{nihongo|March 23|3月23日}} | rituals = }}
This shrine, located in Hashitate, Fuefuki City, is another Ronsha contender. Its name, "Jinsogu," reflects its association with ancestral spirits or the provincial Sōja.
==== Deities ==== * {{ill|Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuninotokotachi|ja|国之常立尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kuninotokotachi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}} * {{ill|Takami Musubi|ja|高皇産霊尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Takami Musubi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to タカミムスビ}} * {{ill|Izanagi|ja|伊弉諾尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanagi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to イザナギ}} * {{ill|Izanami|ja|伊弉冉尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanami|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to イザナミ}}
==== History ==== Located near other provincial landmarks like the [[:en:Kai Kokubun-ji|Kai Kokubun-ji]] and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kai Kokubun-niji|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.
