==== History ==== Located near other provincial landmarks like the [[:en:Kai Kokubun-ji|Kai Kokubun-ji]] and {{ill|Kai Kokubun-niji|ja|甲斐国分尼寺|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kai Kokubun-niji|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}, this site has long been associated with the administrative center of ancient Kai Province.
