=== Kaina Shrine (Kofu) === {{Infobox religious building| religious_affiliation = [[Shinto]] | name = Kaina Shrine | image = [[File:Kaina Shrine Kofu City,from the road outside.JPG|250px]] | location = 3-7-11 Chūō, Kofu City, Yamanashi Prefecture | coordinates = {{Coord|35|39|40.47|N|138|34|41.35|E|region:JP-19_type:landmark|display=inline,title}} | deity = {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kukurihime no Mikoto|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 菊理媛神}}, {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konohana Sakuya Hime|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to コノハナノサクヤビメ}} | status = {{ill|Shikinaisha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|2=ja|3=式内社|qq=draft|1=Shikinaisha|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shikinaisha|13=User:Immanuelle|1=Engishiki Jinmyōchō|2=ja|3=延喜式神名帳|4=zh|5=延喜式神名帳|6=simple|7=Engishiki Jinmyocho|lt=Shikinaisha}} contender, former {{ill|Gōsha|ja|郷社|lt=Ken-sha|1=Modern_system_of_ranked_Shinto_shrines#District_shrine|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gōsha|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 近代社格制度}} | founded = Reign of [[:en:Emperor Suizei|Emperor Suizei]] | main_hall = | othernames = Shirayama Gongen | festivals = {{nihongo|April 15|4月15日}} | rituals = }}
This shrine is located in Kofu City and is linked to the ancient Shirayama faith. It has been known by various names, including "Shirayama Gongen."
==== Deities ==== ; Main Deities * {{ill|Kukurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kukurihime no Mikoto|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 菊理媛神}} * {{ill|Konohana Sakuya Hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konohana Sakuya Hime|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to コノハナノサクヤビメ}} ; Associated Deities * {{ill|Ninigi-no-Mikoto|lt=Ninigi-no-Mikoto|lt=Ninigi|ja|瓊瓊杵命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninigi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to ニニギ}} * {{ill|Ōyamatsumi|ja|大山祇命|1=Ōyamatsumi|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōyamatsumi|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōyamatsumi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to オオヤマツミ}} * [[Iwanaga-hime]]
==== History ==== Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Atago-yama|qq=}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Edo period|qq=}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992|qq=draft|qq=draft}}</ref>
