This shrine, located in Hashitate, Fuefuki City, is another Ronsha contender. Its name, "Jinsogu," reflects its association with ancestral spirits or the provincial Sōja.

==== Deities ====
* {{ill|Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuni-no-Tokotachi|lt=Kuninotokotachi|ja|国之常立尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kuninotokotachi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki link invalid}}
