This shrine, located in Kasugai, Fuefuki City, is one of the primary Ronsha contenders. Its name, ''Shunomiya,'' suggests it may have served as either the "Fourth Shrine" or the provincial Sōja.<ref name="chosa"/>

==== Deities ====
* {{ill|Hoori|lt=Hoori|lt=Hikohohodemi no Mikoto|ja|彦火火出見尊|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hikohohodemi no Mikoto|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to ホオリ}}
* {{ill|Ōkuninushi|ja|大己貴命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōkuninushi|qq=|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 大国主}}

==== History ====
The site is thought to correspond to one of the possible locations of the ancient Kai Province Government Office, as indicated by its name.

During the {{ill|Edo period|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Edo period|qq=}}, the shrine was known as "Shunomiya" or "Shunomiya Daimyōjin." Some scholars interpret this as a variant of "Fourth Shrine" or "Guardian Shrine" (indicating a Sōja).<ref name="chosa"/>

