* {{ill|Kikurihime no Mikoto|ja|菊理姫命|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kikurihime no Mikoto|ja_comment=jawiki redirects to 菊理媛神|1=Kikurihime|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q11619891}}
