==== History ====
Originally located on {{ill|Atago-yama|ja|愛宕山 (甲府市)|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Atago-yama|1=Q11493834|comment=changed title based on wikidata|qid=Q11493834}} in Kofu, the shrine was relocated multiple times, eventually settling in its current location during the {{ill|Edo period|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Edo period|qq=}}.<ref name="chimei">{{Cite book|title=Yamanashi Prefecture Place names|publisher=平凡社|year=1992|qq=draft}}</ref>

